<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Support Services</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  p, li {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-logo {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50px;
    right: 60px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.2em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .content-block {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .two-column {
    display: flex;
    gap: 50px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .column {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .image-container {
    margin-top: 30px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 50px;
    left: 60px;
    right: 60px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for Mayo Clinic Logo -->
    <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;">MAYO CLINIC</span>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5em; font-weight: bold;">Accompanying Talent Support Services</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="two-column">
    <div class="column">
      <div class="content-block">
        <h2 class="section-title">Resources and Services</h2>
        <p>We have resources designed specifically for accompanying talent.</p>
        <p>TOOLKIT: Includes application tips, resume writing, interviewing tips and more.</p>
        <p>APPLICATION TRACKER: An excel spreadsheet to track the positions you applied to.</p>
        <p>Resume, Cover Letter, and Interview videos:</p>
        <p><span data-field="career_website_url">{{ career_website_url }}</span></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Connect?</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Invitation only networking with hiring managers and recruiters</li>
          <li>Learn how to market yourself within the current workforce</li>
          <li>Access to specialists to support you professionally through the transition</li>
          <li>Opportunity for informational interviews or job observations</li>
          <li>Access to Resume Writing and Interviewing workshops</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2 class="section-title">How to Connect</h2>
        <p>It's simple to begin your search! Email <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span> to indicate interest in utilizing our resources and services. An Employment Specialist will respond to your request within 2 business days. The Employment Specialist will request that you complete a short intake form to help plan next steps.</p>
        <p>Mayo Clinic Human Resources has resources and services designed specifically for accompanying talent of Mayo Clinic employees seeking a job opportunity that have recently relocated or will be relocating to <span data-field="location_city">{{ location_city }}</span>, <span data-field="location_state">{{ location_state }}</span>. We offer opportunities to connect with Mayo Clinic departments as well as with external companies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="image-container">
        <!-- Placeholder for Image -->
        <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Support Services" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Partnering with you throughout your job search</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <h3 style="font-weight: bold;">We offer the following resources to you:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Resume writing</li>
          <li>Behavioral Interview Coaching</li>
          <li>Mock Interviews</li>
          <li>Career Counseling</li>
          <li>Networking and Building Connections</li>
          <li>Classes and workshops</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p>Recruiters are assigned to specific departments and their name is listed at the bottom of each job posting. The recruiter can answer questions specific to the job posting such as: Qualifications, schedule, compensation, and feedback.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <p>Hiring Managers request a new position to be filled. They work with the recruiter to identify viable candidates. The hiring manager will ultimately be the direct manager of the new hire. Apart from the roles defined above, throughout this journey you may be partnered with other business professionals, depending on individualized need.</p>
        <p>Contact HR Connect for questions related to benefits or online application assistance. Please call 507-266-0440 or 888-266-0440.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="footer">
    <span data-field="contact_email_footer">{{ contact_email_footer }}</span>
    <div>
      ©2019 Mayo Foundation for Medical Education and Research. All rights reserved. Mayo Clinic is an equal opportunity educator and employer (including veterans and persons with disabilities).<br>
      MC5152-145
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>